<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Registration Guide</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .header-logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
  .nav-link { text-decoration: none; color: #000; margin-right: 15px; }
  .section-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .instruction-list li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
  .button { padding: 8px 15px; border: 1px solid #000; background-color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1>ONLINE REGISTRATION INSTRUCTIONS GUIDE</h1>
  <p>TERM REGISTRATION: Please make sure you are a current OLLI member and that your membership has not expired. Memberships expiring within the dates of the term require renewal prior to term registration.</p>

  <ol>
    <li>Go to <span data-field="registration_url">{{ registration_url }}</span> and click on "Sign In".</li>
  </ol>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <div style="width: 20px; height: 20px; border: 2px solid red; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <p style="margin: 0;">CURRENT OR PAST OLLI AT UAH MEMBERS</p>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Are you a current or past <span data-field="membership_status">{{ membership_status }}</span> member and need to renew your membership? Please sign in using the button below. Membership payment is required before registration can begin!</p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <span class="button">SIGN IN</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">New to OLLI at UAH?</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Are you new to OLLI at UAH? Please create an online account using the button below. Membership payment is required before course registration can begin!</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span class="button">CREATE AN ACCOUNT</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 15px;">View detailed instructions on how to become a member.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ol start="2">
    <li>Log in to your account by inserting your username and password.</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">The University of Alabama in Huntsville</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span class="nav-link">Welcome to OLLI at UAH</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account HOME</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cart</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account</span>
      <span style="margin-left: 20px;">[User Icon]</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-title">Course Selection</div>
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding: 0;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="course_link_1">{{ course_link_1 }}</span></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="course_link_2">{{ course_link_2 }}</span></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="course_link_3">{{ course_link_3 }}</span></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="course_link_4">{{ course_link_4 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div class="section-title">YOUR ACCOUNT</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Already have an Online Account?</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Forgot Username? <a href="#" style="color: blue;">Forgot Username</a> or call <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span> for assistance.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Previously Registered, but not Enrolled?</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Click <a href="#" style="color: blue;">here</a> to register online and view a Username and Password!</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">Need help? <a href="#" style="color: blue;">Contact Us</a> or call <span data-field="phone_number_2">{{ phone_number_2 }}</span> for assistance.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="section-title">Already have an account?</div>
        <form>
          <label for="username" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Username</label>
          <input type="text" id="username" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <label for="password" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Password</label>
          <input type="password" id="password" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
            <span class="button">Login</span>
            <span class="button">Forgot Username?</span>
            <span class="button">Forgot Password?</span>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="section-title">Upcoming Registrations:</div>
    <p style="font-size: 14px;">Start Date: <span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">The University of Alabama in Huntsville</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span class="nav-link">Welcome to OLLI at UAH</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account HOME</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cart</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account</span>
      <span style="margin-left: 20px;">[User Icon]</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="section-title">SEARCH</div>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Welcome!</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Enter a keyword, choose a day or category to display OLLI courses.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Clicking search without specifying any search variables will list all courses.</p>
    <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <label for="keyword" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Keyword</label>
          <input type="text" id="keyword" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <label for="session" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Session</label>
          <select id="session" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <option value="">Session</option>
            <option value="spring">Spring</option>
            <option value="summer">Summer</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <label for="category" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Category</label>
          <select id="category" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <option value="">Category</option>
            <option value="history">History</option>
            <option value="science">Science</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
          <label for="day" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Day of Week</label>
          <select id="day" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <option value="">Day</option>
            <option value="mon">Mon</option>
            <option value="tue">Tue</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <span class="button" style="margin-right: 10px;">Search</span>
        <span class="button">Clear Search</span>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">The University of Alabama in Huntsville</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span class="nav-link">Welcome to OLLI at UAH</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account HOME</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cart</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account</span>
      <span style="margin-left: 20px;">[User Icon]</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="section-title">SEARCH RESULTS</div>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Click on Title or Dates column label to change sort.</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Title</th>
          <th>Session</th>
          <th>Dates</th>
          <th>Times</th>
          <th>Days</th>
          <th>Fee</th>
          <th>Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for course in search_results %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="course.title">{{ course.title }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.session">{{ course.session }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.dates">{{ course.dates }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.times">{{ course.times }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.days">{{ course.days }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.fee">{{ course.fee }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="course.status">{{ course.status }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">The University of Alabama in Huntsville</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span class="nav-link">Welcome to OLLI at UAH</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account HOME</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cart</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account</span>
      <span style="margin-left: 20px;">[User Icon]</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="section-title">COURSE DETAILS</div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">You will need to make a price selection for each course.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Course ID: <span data-field="course_id">{{ course_id }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Course Name: <span data-field="course_name">{{ course_name }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Category: <span data-field="course_category">{{ course_category }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Dates: <span data-field="course_dates">{{ course_dates }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Times: <span data-field="course_times">{{ course_times }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Instructor: <span data-field="course_instructor">{{ course_instructor }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px;">Instructor Bio:</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12px;">{{ instructor_bio }}</p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <div class="section-title">Fee(s)</div>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><span data-field="fee_item_1_description">{{ fee_item_1_description }}</span></td>
              <td><span data-field="fee_item_1_amount">{{ fee_item_1_amount }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><span data-field="fee_item_2_description">{{ fee_item_2_description }}</span></td>
              <td><span data-field="fee_item_2_amount">{{ fee_item_2_amount }}</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div style="margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
          <p style="font-size: 12px;">Need to register for someone else? Click <a href="#" style="color: blue;">here</a></p>
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px;">
            <span class="button">Back</span>
            <span class="button">Add to Cart</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; background-color: #eee; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-right: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">The University of Alabama in Huntsville</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span class="nav-link">Welcome to OLLI at UAH</span>
      <span class="nav-link">My Account HOME</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cart (2)</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Cancel Order</span>
      <span class="nav-link">Account: Alejandra Pacheco</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="section-title">YOUR CART</div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Course ID</th>
          <th>Title / Schedule</th>
          <th>Qty</th>
          <th>Item Price</th>
          <th>Total</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for cart_item in cart_items %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="cart_item.course_id">{{ cart_item.course_id }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cart_item.title">{{ cart_item.title }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cart_item.quantity">{{ cart_item.quantity }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cart_item.price">{{ cart_item.price }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="cart_item.subtotal">{{ cart_item.subtotal }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;">
      <table style="width: 40%;">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Sub-Total:</td>
            <td><span data-field="cart_summary.subtotal">{{ cart_summary.subtotal }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Registration Fee:</td>
            <td><span data-field="cart_summary.registration_fee">{{ cart_summary.registration_fee }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Tax:</td>
            <td><span data-field="cart_summary.tax">{{ cart_summary.tax }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;">TOTAL:</td>
            <td style="font-weight: bold;"><span data-field="cart_summary.total">{{ cart_summary.total }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <span class="button">Inquire</span>
      <span class="button">Contact Info</span>
      <span class="button">Privacy Policy</span>
      <span class="button">Refund Policy</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <ol class="instruction-list">
    <li>Fill out "Required Information"</li>
    <li>Fill out "Payment Details"</li>
    <li>Click on "Next Step"</li>
    <li>Click on "Submit"</li>
  </ol>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">* You will be receiving an automatic confirmation email stating all the courses you have registered for and the payment information.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>